{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國務卿馬爾科·魯比奧當地時間11月17日表示，近期美國接連發生的多起科技系統故障之間沒有關聯，也沒有任何證據表明這些事件是由黑客、犯罪組織、外國政府或其他惡意行為者發動的網絡攻擊。他強調，美國並未遭受系統性攻擊，各起事件的原因各不相同。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586894.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.549888+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:21:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_hash":"d4a6a03a2e03a56e83d1424a6a5a5bc750fe848b1cf7df9ff984f81b77f97c82","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}